{"product_id":"awakened-a-house-of-night-novel-pb","title":"AWAKENED A HOUSE OF NIGHT NOVEL PB.","description":"\u003cp\u003eExonerated by the Vampyre High Council and returned to her position of High Priestess at Tulsa's House of Night, Neferet has sworn vengeance on Zoey. But Zoey has found sanctuary on the Isle of Skye and is being groomed by Queen Sgiach to take over for her there. Being Queen would be cool, wouldn't it? And what about Stevie Rae and Rephraim? The Raven Mocker refuses to be used against Stevie Rae, but what choice does he have when no one in the entire world, including Zoey, would be ok with their relationship? Does he betray his father or his heart?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 125 x 230\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: P.C. Cast | Kristin Cast\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781905654857\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45195441930393,"sku":"7RC9781905654857","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c87f165be16_AWAKENED_20A_20HOUSE_20OF_20NIGHT_20NOVEL_20PB._20P.C._20Cast_20__20Kristin_20Cast_20_1.jpg?v=1752084578","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/awakened-a-house-of-night-novel-pb","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}